  "description": "There is nothing better than the feeling when the sun has finally set and a crescent moon comes out of hiding to brighten the sky alongside the stars. Keep this emotion alive with these boho-themed crescent moon illustrations with floral elements. The Crescent Moon Clipart Free set contains 10 unique images of crescent moons. You can use these elements as a simple accent to a greeting card or wedding invitation, add to a tote bag to make all your hipster dreams come true, or make them into fun stickers to share with your friends. The options are as endless as the sky. All moons are craft-friendly so you can easily print, cut, and sublimate.\nUpon download you will receive the following file types:\n\nDXF\nEPS\nJPG\nPNG\nSVG",
  "fullDescription": "<p>There is nothing better than the feeling when the sun has finally set and a crescent moon comes out of hiding to brighten the sky alongside the stars. Keep this emotion alive with these boho-themed crescent moon illustrations with floral elements. The Crescent Moon Clipart Free set contains 10 unique images of crescent moons. You can use these elements as a simple accent to a greeting card or wedding invitation, add to a tote bag to make all your hipster dreams come true, or make them into fun stickers to share with your friends. The options are as endless as the sky. All moons are craft-friendly so you can easily print, cut, and sublimate.</p>\n<p>Upon download you will receive the following file types:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DXF</li>\n<li>EPS</li>\n<li>JPG</li>\n<li>PNG</li>\n<li>SVG</li>\n</ul>",
